<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#090d1a">
    <meta name="description" content="Build your skills, explore career paths, and plan your next move with CareerBuild.">
    <title>CareerBuild — Your career, in progress</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar">
        <a class="brand" href="#home" aria-label="CareerBuild home">
            <span class="brand-mark">C</span>
            <span>career<span class="brand-accent">build</span><small>YOUR CAREER, IN PROGRESS</small></span>
        </a>
        <button class="sidebar-close" id="sidebar-close" type="button" aria-label="Close navigation">×</button>
        <div class="nav-label">WORKSPACE</div>
        <nav class="primary-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
            <a class="nav-link active" href="#home"><span class="nav-icon">⌂</span>Overview</a>
            <a class="nav-link" href="#careers"><span class="nav-icon">◈</span>Explore careers</a>
            <a class="nav-link" href="#assessment"><span class="nav-icon">◎</span>Skill assessment</a>
            <a class="nav-link" href="#roadmap"><span class="nav-icon">↗</span>Learning roadmap</a>
            <a class="nav-link" href="#internships"><span class="nav-icon">▤</span>Internships</a>
            <a class="nav-link" href="#resume"><span class="nav-icon">▧</span>Resume builder</a>
            <a class="nav-link" href="#assistant"><span class="nav-icon">✳</span>Career assistant<span class="nav-new">BETA</span></a>
        </nav>
        <div class="sidebar-bottom">
            <div class="sidebar-tip">
                <span class="tip-icon">✦</span>
                <strong>Small steps add up.</strong>
                <p>Keep showing up for your future self.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sidebar-user">
                <div class="avatar" id="sidebar-avatar">S</div>
                <div><strong id="sidebar-name">Your profile</strong><span>Career explorer</span></div>
                <span class="user-dots">•••</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </aside>

    <main class="main-content" id="home">
        <header class="topbar">
            <button class="mobile-menu" id="menu-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Toggle navigation" aria-expanded="false">☰</button>
            <div class="breadcrumb">Workspace <span>/</span> <strong>Overview</strong></div>
            <div class="topbar-right">
                <span class="today-label" id="today-label"></span>
                <div class="top-avatar" id="top-avatar">S</div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="page-content">
            <section class="welcome hero-panel">
                <div class="hero-copy">
                    <div class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> YOUR PERSONAL CAREER SPACE</div>
                    <h1>Your next chapter<br>starts <span>right here.</span></h1>
                    <p>Explore what excites you, build real-world skills, and make your career goals feel closer every day.</p>
                    <a href="#careers" class="button button-primary">Explore career paths <span>↗</span></a>
                </div>
                <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div>
                    <div class="orbit-core"><span>✦</span></div>
                    <div class="orbit-chip chip-one">✧ Learn</div>
                    <div class="orbit-chip chip-two">↗ Grow</div>
                    <div class="orbit-chip chip-three">◎ Discover</div>
                    <div class="hero-spark spark-one">✦</div><div class="hero-spark spark-two">✧</div>
                </div>
                <div class="hero-foot"><span>MADE FOR YOUR AMBITION</span><span>01 — YOUR JOURNEY</span></div>
            </section>

            <section class="stats-grid" aria-label="Your career progress">
                <article class="stat-card">
                    <div class="stat-top"><span class="stat-icon purple">◈</span><span class="stat-trend">YOUR SPACE</span></div>
                    <div class="stat-value">04</div><div class="stat-label">Career paths to explore</div>
                </article>
                <article class="stat-card">
                    <div class="stat-top"><span class="stat-icon cyan">◎</span><span class="stat-trend">KEEP GOING</span></div>
                    <div class="stat-value" id="skills-count">00</div><div class="stat-label">Roadmap steps completed</div>
                </article>
                <article class="stat-card">
                    <div class="stat-top"><span class="stat-icon pink">✳</span><span class="stat-trend">READY WHEN YOU ARE</span></div>
                    <div class="stat-value">05</div><div class="stat-label">Internship discovery links</div>
                </article>
                <article class="stat-card progress-stat">
                    <div class="stat-top"><span class="stat-icon green">↗</span><span class="stat-trend">YOUR MOMENTUM</span></div>
                    <div class="stat-value"><span id="overall-progress">0</span><small>%</small></div>
                    <div class="stat-label">Learning roadmap progress</div>
                    <div class="mini-progress"><span id="overall-progress-bar"></span></div>
                </article>
            </section>

            <section class="section-block" id="careers">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <div><div class="eyebrow">FIND YOUR DIRECTION</div><h2>Career paths worth exploring<span class="heading-dot">.</span></h2><p class="section-subtitle">A starting point, not a box. See what each path could look like.</p></div>
                    <span class="section-count">01 / 04</span>
                </div>
                <div class="career-grid">
                    <article class="career-card career-ai">
                        <div class="career-card-top"><span class="career-icon">✳</span><span class="career-tag">BUILD THE FUTURE</span></div>
                        <h3>AI / ML Engineer</h3><p>Teach computers to find patterns, make predictions, and solve problems that matter.</p>
                        <div class="skill-chips"><span>Python</span><span>Machine learning</span><span>Math</span></div>
                        <button class="text-button career-details" data-career="ai">Explore this path <span>↗</span></button>
                    </article>
                    <article class="career-card career-fullstack">
                        <div class="career-card-top"><span class="career-icon">⌘</span><span class="career-tag">MAKE IDEAS REAL</span></div>
                        <h3>Full Stack Developer</h3><p>Build complete digital experiences, from the first click to the systems behind it.</p>
                        <div class="skill-chips"><span>JavaScript</span><span>Frontend</span><span>Backend</span></div>
                        <button class="text-button career-details" data-career="fullstack">Explore this path <span>↗</span></button>
                    </article>
                    <article class="career-card career-data">
                        <div class="career-card-top"><span class="career-icon">▥</span><span class="career-tag">FIND THE SIGNAL</span></div>
                        <h3>Data Scientist</h3><p>Turn messy data into clear insights that help people make better decisions.</p>
                        <div class="skill-chips"><span>SQL</span><span>Statistics</span><span>Python</span></div>
                        <button class="text-button career-details" data-career="data">Explore this path <span>↗</span></button>
                    </article>
                    <article class="career-card career-security">
                        <div class="career-card-top"><span class="career-icon">⬡</span><span class="career-tag">PROTECT WHAT MATTERS</span></div>
                        <h3>Cybersecurity Engineer</h3><p>Help protect people, systems, and information in an increasingly connected world.</p>
                        <div class="skill-chips"><span>Networking</span><span>Linux</span><span>Security</span></div>
                        <button class="text-button career-details" data-career="security">Explore this path <span>↗</span></button>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="section-block" id="assessment">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <div><div class="eyebrow">LEARN WHAT YOU KNOW</div><h2>A quick skills check<span class="heading-dot">.</span></h2><p class="section-subtitle">Try a few questions and get a snapshot of your fundamentals.</p></div>
                    <span class="section-count">02 / 04</span>
                </div>
                <div class="assessment-panel">
                    <div class="assessment-intro">
                        <div class="assessment-orb">◎</div><div class="eyebrow">PROGRAMMING FUNDAMENTALS</div>
                        <h3>Curious where to start?</h3>
                        <p>This short, five-question check-in is a low-pressure way to spot topics to practice next.</p>
                        <button class="button button-primary" id="start-quiz" type="button">Start assessment <span>→</span></button>
                        <p class="fine-print">No grades, just a helpful starting point.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="quiz-area" id="quiz-area" aria-live="polite">
                        <div class="quiz-placeholder"><span>✧</span><strong>Your assessment will appear here</strong><p>Take it at your own pace. You can try again anytime.</p></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="section-block" id="roadmap">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <div><div class="eyebrow">MAKE A LITTLE PROGRESS</div><h2>Your learning roadmap<span class="heading-dot">.</span></h2><p class="section-subtitle">Pick a path, check off steps, and keep your momentum going.</p></div>
                    <span class="section-count">03 / 04</span>
                </div>
                <div class="roadmap-panel">
                    <div class="roadmap-header">
                        <div><span class="roadmap-kicker">YOUR STARTING ROADMAP</span><h3 id="roadmap-title">Full Stack Developer</h3></div>
                        <label class="select-wrap"><span class="visually-hidden">Choose roadmap</span><select id="roadmap-select" aria-label="Choose a learning roadmap">
                            <option value="fullstack">Full Stack Developer</option><option value="ai">AI / ML Engineer</option><option value="data">Data Scientist</option><option value="security">Cybersecurity Engineer</option>
                        </select></label>
                    </div>
                    <div class="roadmap-progress-line"><div class="roadmap-progress-copy"><span id="roadmap-progress-label">0 of 6 steps complete</span><span id="roadmap-percent">0%</span></div><div class="progress-track"><span id="roadmap-progress-bar"></span></div></div>
                    <div class="roadmap-list" id="roadmap-list"></div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="section-block" id="internships">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <div><div class="eyebrow">TAKE THE NEXT STEP</div><h2>Find your first opportunity<span class="heading-dot">.</span></h2><p class="section-subtitle">Explore entry-level and student opportunities from these company career pages.</p></div>
                    <span class="section-count">04 / 04</span>
                </div>
                <div class="internship-note"><span>ⓘ</span> These are links to company career search pages, not verified live vacancies. Check each page for current openings and eligibility.</div>
                <div class="internship-grid">
                    <article class="internship-card"><div class="company-mark google-mark">G</div><div class="internship-info"><span class="job-type">STUDENT OPPORTUNITIES</span><h3>Google</h3><p>Internships across engineering, data, and more.</p><div class="job-skills"><span>Engineering</span><span>Students</span></div></div><a class="external-link" href="https://www.google.com/about/careers/applications/students/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Explore Google student opportunities">↗</a></article>
                    <article class="internship-card"><div class="company-mark microsoft-mark">▦</div><div class="internship-info"><span class="job-type">EARLY CAREER</span><h3>Microsoft</h3><p>Student roles, internships, and university programs.</p><div class="job-skills"><span>Technology</span><span>Students</span></div></div><a class="external-link" href="https://careers.microsoft.com/v2/global/en/students" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Explore Microsoft student opportunities">↗</a></article>
                    <article class="internship-card"><div class="company-mark adobe-mark">A</div><div class="internship-info"><span class="job-type">STUDENT CAREERS</span><h3>Adobe</h3><p>Explore internships and early career opportunities.</p><div class="job-skills"><span>Creative tech</span><span>Students</span></div></div><a class="external-link" href="https://careers.adobe.com/us/en/students" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Explore Adobe student opportunities">↗</a></article>
                    <article class="internship-card"><div class="company-mark amazon-mark">a</div><div class="internship-info"><span class="job-type">STUDENT PROGRAMS</span><h3>Amazon</h3><p>Browse student programs in tech and business.</p><div class="job-skills"><span>Technology</span><span>Students</span></div></div><a class="external-link" href="https://www.amazon.jobs/content/en/career-programs/university" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Explore Amazon student opportunities">↗</a></article>
                    <article class="internship-card"><div class="company-mark ibm-mark">IBM</div><div class="internship-info"><span class="job-type">EARLY CAREER</span><h3>IBM</h3><p>Find internships, co-ops, and entry-level roles.</p><div class="job-skills"><span>Technology</span><span>Research</span></div></div><a class="external-link" href="https://www.ibm.com/careers/students" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Explore IBM student opportunities">↗</a></article>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="section-block" id="resume">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <div><div class="eyebrow">TELL YOUR STORY</div><h2>A resume that sounds like you<span class="heading-dot">.</span></h2><p class="section-subtitle">Add your details to create a clean, printable resume preview.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="resume-layout">
                    <form id="resume-form" class="resume-form" novalidate>
                        <div class="form-section-title"><span>01</span><div><h3>Your details</h3><p>The best way to get in touch with you.</p></div></div>
                        <div class="form-grid">
                            <label>Full name <input type="text" id="studentName" name="name" placeholder="e.g. Alex Morgan" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="80"></label>
                            <label>Career goal <input type="text" id="studentRole" name="role" placeholder="e.g. Aspiring frontend developer" required maxlength="100"></label>
                            <label>Email address <input type="email" id="studentEmail" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="120"></label>
                            <label>Phone (optional) <input type="tel" id="studentPhone" name="phone" placeholder="+1 555 010 1234" autocomplete="tel" maxlength="30"></label>
                        </div>
                        <label>Education <textarea id="studentEducation" name="education" placeholder="Degree or program, school, graduation year" required maxlength="500"></textarea></label>
                        <label>Skills <textarea id="studentSkills" name="skills" placeholder="e.g. JavaScript, Figma, communication" required maxlength="500"></textarea></label>
                        <label>Projects <textarea id="studentProjects" name="projects" placeholder="Project name — what you built and what you learned" required maxlength="1000"></textarea></label>
                        <div class="form-actions"><button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Generate resume preview <span>→</span></button><button class="button button-quiet" id="clear-resume" type="button">Clear form</button></div>
                        <p class="form-hint" id="resume-message" aria-live="polite">Your information stays in this browser and is not sent to a server.</p>
                    </form>
                    <div class="resume-preview-wrap">
                        <div class="preview-topline"><span>LIVE PREVIEW</span><button class="button button-small" id="download-resume" type="button" disabled>Print / Save PDF <span>↓</span></button></div>
                        <div id="resume-output" class="resume-paper"><div class="empty-resume"><span>▧</span><strong>Your resume will take shape here.</strong><p>Fill in the details to preview it. Use “Print / Save PDF” to download a copy.</p></div></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="section-block" id="assistant">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <div><div class="eyebrow">A THOUGHTFUL PLACE TO START</div><h2>Your career assistant<span class="heading-dot">.</span></h2><p class="section-subtitle">Collect your questions and get clear on what you want to explore.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="assistant-panel">
                    <div class="assistant-heading"><div class="assistant-avatar">✳</div><div><h3>CareerBuild guide</h3><p><span class="status-dot"></span> Frontend demo · AI is not connected</p></div><span class="assistant-lock">NO AI API</span></div>
                    <div class="assistant-disclaimer"><span>ⓘ</span><p>This frontend does not connect to an AI service, so it won't generate or pretend to generate AI answers. Your notes stay in this page. Connect a backend and an AI provider in a later phase to enable personalized chat.</p></div>
                    <div class="chat-messages" id="chat-messages" aria-live="polite">
                        <div class="chat-message guide-message"><span class="message-avatar">✳</span><div><span class="message-sender">CAREERBUILD GUIDE</span><p>What would you like to think through? You can jot down a question below, or use one of these prompts to get started.</p></div></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="suggested-prompts">
                        <button type="button" class="prompt-chip">What skills should I learn first?</button>
                        <button type="button" class="prompt-chip">How can I prepare for an interview?</button>
                        <button type="button" class="prompt-chip">Help me compare career paths</button>
                    </div>
                    <form class="chat-form" id="chat-form"><label class="visually-hidden" for="chat-input">Write a career question</label><input id="chat-input" type="text" maxlength="500" placeholder="Write down a career question..." required><button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Add note <span>↑</span></button></form>
                    <p class="chat-footnote">Your note is shown for this session only. No AI response is generated.</p>
                </div>
            </section>
            <footer class="site-footer"><a class="brand footer-brand" href="#home"><span class="brand-mark">C</span><span>career<span class="brand-accent">build</span><small>YOUR CAREER, IN PROGRESS</small></span></a><span>Build skills. Build confidence. Build your future.</span><a href="#home" class="back-top">Back to top ↑</a></footer>
        </div>
    </main>

    <dialog class="career-dialog" id="career-dialog" aria-labelledby="dialog-title">
        <button class="dialog-close" id="dialog-close" type="button" aria-label="Close career details">×</button>
        <div id="career-detail"></div>
    </dialog>
    <div class="toast" id="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
